# Run 2026-11-01, Creative Split wave 1: SQ-CAL (Calendar carve) and SQ-CDV (Devtools carve), group A superflat.
# Boot 1 on the instance config (CE toml still holds [seasons]/[time]/[crop_seasons]). Restart rows in cs1b_restart.qb.
pace 2

## SQ-CAL-01 | calendar loads, first-boot moved-keys WARN, mixins
bootexpect \[creativecalendar\] time, seasons and crop seasons loaded
bootexpect still has keys that moved to config/creativecalendar-common.toml
bootreject creativecalendar\.mixins\.json.*(Error|error|failed)
shell grep -c "from creativecalendar.mixins.json" logs/debug.log; grep -o "Mixing [A-Za-z]* from creativecalendar.mixins.json" logs/debug.log | sort -u
look debug.log mixes 10 common mixins (CropSeasonGrowHook only with IE / Dirty Stuff / Nether's Delight)

## SQ-CAL-02 | config split (first half; restart half in cs1b)
shell grep -nE "^\s*\[" config/creativecalendar-common.toml; grep -n "seasonsMeltIntervalTicks\|cropSeasons\|cropOutOfSeason" config/creativecalendar-common.toml; echo CE:; grep -nE "^\[(seasons|time|crop_seasons)\]" config/creativeengineering-common.toml || echo "CE has no calendar sections"
look calendar file has [seasons], [crop_seasons], [time.*], [perf] seasonsMeltIntervalTicks = 4, [wthit]; CE file lost them

## SQ-CAL-03 | script pack order and calendar scripts
shell grep -E "startup script packs in order|creativecalendar\]|global.CAL missing" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log
kjsexpect \[creativecalendar\] server scripts ready, features on: seasons, crop_seasons, time
kjsreject global\.CAL missing
look pack order lists creativecalendar before creativedelight and creativebrewing; core finished line present

## SQ-CDV-01 | devtools loads
bootexpect \[creativedevtools\] loaded, members: \[ceperfbot, cecapture\]
bootreject \[creativedevtools\].*NOT loaded
bootreject NoClassDefFoundError.*(BlockStateLookupHook|LevelRandomHook)
kjsexpect \[creativedevtools\] server scripts ready
shell grep -E "\[creativedevtools\]" logs/kubejs/startup.log; grep -E "ERROR.*creativedevtools" logs/latest.log | head -5; grep -nE "^\s*\[" config/creativedevtools-common.toml; echo CE:; grep -nE "^\s*\[(debug|worldgen\.mass_place)" config/creativeengineering-common.toml || echo "CE has no debug/mass_place"
look startup core finished; toml has [debug.*], [worldgen.mass_place], [features]; CE toml lost [debug] and [worldgen.mass_place]

## SQ-CAL-04 | /cetime commands
bootexpect \[time\] Better Days from \[time\]
> cetime
> cetime push
> cetime date
reject Unknown command
expect 45
look /cetime shows day 45 + night 15 min, 8 days per sub-season, preset SINGLEPLAYER; push and date answer in SQ-TD-01 format

## SQ-CAL-05 | season clock follows the sun
> cetime date
> time add 24000
sleep 3
> cetime date
> season
reject Unknown command
look day +1 in both cetime lines, /season agrees

## SQ-CAL-06 | season and crop season tags
> locate biome #creativeengineering:seasons/arid
waitlog (Located|Could not find) 180
expect (desert|badlands)
> forceload add 30 30
sleep 3
> setblock 30 -61 30 minecraft:farmland
> setblock 30 -60 30 minecraft:wheat
> execute if block 30 -60 30 #creativeengineering:crop_seasons/temperate run say CALTAG temperate
> setblock 32 -60 30 minecraft:glass
> execute if block 32 -60 30 #sereneseasons:greenhouse_glass run say CALTAG glass
expect CALTAG temperate
expect CALTAG glass

## SQ-CAL-07 | wine clock moves with the calendar
> wine time
> cetime date add 1 month
> wine time
reject Unknown command
reject WineTime|NoClassDefFound
look wine clock moves 8 days with the month

## SQ-CDV-02 | devtools commands answer
> cegen list
> ceperf status
> ceplace status
> recipescan
waitlog (?i)(recipescan|recipe scan).*(done|summary|checked|recipes|references) 300
> dumpworldjei
sleep 10
> dumpspawns
sleep 10
reject Unknown command
shell ls -la kubejs/exported/spawns.json; grep -rn "flowerworld" kubejs/server_scripts logs/kubejs/server.log | head -3
look every command answered; /recipescan summary line; spawns.json written now; /flowerworld registered (not run)

## SQ-CDV-04 | devtools test recipes under the creativedevtools namespace (probe half in cs1b)
> dumprecipes create
sleep 20
shell grep -rho "creativedevtools:[^\"]*" kubejs/exported/recipes/ | sort -u | head -30
look one *_mech_crafting per metal and wood, netherite, one sequenced assembly, all creativedevtools:

## SQ-CDV-03 | /dumpall (about 5 min)
> dumpall
waitlog \[dumpall\] all \d+ dumps done 900
expect \[dumpall\] all 25 dumps done
kjsreject ReferenceError
kjsreject guardThrowable.*(not|undefined)|writeExportJson.*(not|undefined)
